public sealed class ExistingFFmpegDocumentaryVariantProviderBinding(IProcessRunner runner,FfmpegArgumentBuilder builder,IOptions<RenderingOptions> rendering):IDocumentaryVariantCompositionProviderBinding {
 public string ProviderId=>DocumentaryVariantCompositionProviderIds.ExistingFFmpegVariantComposer;
 public async Task<DocumentaryVariantCompositionProviderResponse> ComposeAsync(DocumentaryVariantCompositionProviderRequest r,CancellationToken token){token.ThrowIfCancellationRequested();if(r.OutputFormat!=DocumentaryMediaAssetFormat.Mp4||r.Width<=0||r.Height<=0||r.FrameRate<=0||r.ExpectedDurationMilliseconds<=0||string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(r.OutputDirectory)||r.OrderedScenePaths.Count==0||r.OrderedScenePaths.Any(string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace)||!Enum.IsDefined(r.AudioPolicy))return Fail(DocumentaryProductionFailureCode.ProviderRejectedRequest,"The variant profile is unsupported.");Directory.CreateDirectory(r.OutputDirectory);var output=Path.Combine(Path.GetFullPath(r.OutputDirectory),"provider-variant.mp4");var list=Path.Combine(r.OutputDirectory,"provider-scenes.txt");await File.WriteAllTextAsync(list,string.Join('\n',r.OrderedScenePaths.Select(p=>$"file '{p.Replace("'","'\\''",StringComparison.Ordinal)}'"))+"\n",new UTF8Encoding(false),token);var args=builder.BuildVariant(rendering.Value,list,output,r.Width,r.Height,(int)r.FrameRate,r.AudioPolicy==DocumentaryVariantAudioPolicy.RequireAudio);ProcessExecutionResult result;try{result=await runner.ExecuteAsync(rendering.Value.FfmpegPath,args,token,TimeSpan.FromSeconds(Math.Max(1,(r.Height>r.Width?rendering.Value.FinalShortRenderTimeoutSeconds:rendering.Value.FinalLongRenderTimeoutSeconds))));}catch(OperationCanceledException) when(token.IsCancellationRequested){throw;}catch(System.ComponentModel.Win32Exception){return Fail(DocumentaryProductionFailureCode.DependencyMissing,"The FFmpeg executable is unavailable.");}catch(Exception e) when(e is IOException or UnauthorizedAccessException){return Fail(DocumentaryProductionFailureCode.ProcessStartFailed,"FFmpeg could not be started.");}var hash=Convert.ToHexString(SHA256.HashData(Encoding.UTF8.GetBytes(result.StandardError??string.Empty))).ToLowerInvariant();if(result.TimedOut)return new(null,new(DocumentaryProductionFailureCode.ProcessTimedOut,"FFmpeg variant composition timed out."),result.ExitCode,(long)result.Duration.TotalMilliseconds,hash,r.CompositionMode);if(!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(result.ExceptionText))return new(null,new(DocumentaryProductionFailureCode.ProcessStartFailed,"FFmpeg could not be started."),result.ExitCode,(long)result.Duration.TotalMilliseconds,hash,r.CompositionMode);if(result.ExitCode!=0)return new(null,new(DocumentaryProductionFailureCode.ProcessExitedWithError,"FFmpeg variant composition failed."),result.ExitCode,(long)result.Duration.TotalMilliseconds,hash,r.CompositionMode);if(!File.Exists(output))return new(null,new(DocumentaryProductionFailureCode.OutputArtifactMissing,"FFmpeg produced no variant video."),result.ExitCode,(long)result.Duration.TotalMilliseconds,hash,r.CompositionMode);if(new FileInfo(output).Length==0)return new(null,new(DocumentaryProductionFailureCode.OutputArtifactEmpty,"FFmpeg produced an empty variant video."),result.ExitCode,(long)result.Duration.TotalMilliseconds,hash,r.CompositionMode);return new(output,null,result.ExitCode,(long)result.Duration.TotalMilliseconds,hash,r.CompositionMode);}
